<figure class="tgw-route-domains" aria-labelledby="tgw-route-title">
  <figcaption id="tgw-route-title"><span class="content-kicker">Two controls, two directions</span><strong>Association chooses a lookup table. Propagation contributes routes to tables.</strong></figcaption>
  <div class="tgw-grid">
    <section>
      <span class="step">Packet arrives</span>
      <b>App VPC attachment</b>
      <i aria-hidden="true">association ↓</i>
      <strong>Use App route table</strong>
      <i aria-hidden="true">lookup ↓</i>
      <b>10.20.0.0/16 → Database attachment</b>
    </section>
    <section class="propagation">
      <span class="step">Reachability is advertised</span>
      <b>Database VPC attachment</b>
      <i aria-hidden="true">propagation ↓</i>
      <strong>Install 10.20.0.0/16</strong>
      <i aria-hidden="true">into ↓</i>
      <b>Selected TGW route tables</b>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div class="return-warning"><b>Return traffic starts a new lookup.</b><span>It arrives on the Database attachment and uses that attachment’s associated table.</span></div>
</figure>

<style>
  .tgw-route-domains { margin: 28px 0; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.014); }
  figcaption { display: grid; gap: 7px; margin-bottom: 17px; }
  figcaption strong { font-size: 1rem; }
  .tgw-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
  section { display: grid; gap: 8px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(66,214,232,.24); border-radius: 9px; background: rgba(66,214,232,.035); text-align: center; }
  section.propagation { border-color: rgba(183,154,255,.24); background: rgba(183,154,255,.035); }
  section .step { color: var(--dim); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .54rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
  section b, section strong { padding: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--surface); font-size: .65rem; }
  section strong { color: var(--cyan); }
  section.propagation strong { color: var(--purple); }
  section i { color: var(--green); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .53rem; font-style: normal; }
  .return-warning { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 12px; padding: 12px; border-left: 2px solid var(--amber); background: rgba(246,199,99,.035); font-size: .65rem; }
  .return-warning span { color: var(--muted); }
  @media (max-width: 650px) { .tgw-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .return-warning { flex-direction: column; } }
</style>
